cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "hdWGCNA Bridge"
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using these metadata."
type: software
authors:
  - alias: shayarapal
    email: shayarapal2000@gmail.com
    # Set given-names and family-names before archiving for the paper: Zenodo
    # builds the DOI's author record from these fields, and an alias alone
    # produces a citation with no human-readable author.
repository-code: "https://github.com/shayarapal/rise_hdwgnca"
abstract: >-
  A plumber-based R microservice that exposes the hdWGCNA single-cell
  co-expression pipeline over HTTP, so it can be driven from a Python
  backend. The service is a thin wrapper: hdWGCNA and Seurat functions are
  called as documented upstream, with no part of the algorithm
  reimplemented, approximated, or ported to Python.
keywords:
  - hdWGCNA
  - WGCNA
  - gene co-expression network analysis
  - single-cell transcriptomics
  - Seurat
  - plumber
license: GPL-3.0-or-later
version: 0.4.0
date-released: "2026-09-10"
